The rightmost cell of the top row of any tableau has hook length 1:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->900694234,ExpressionUUID->"f0137119-06c5-4264-a98a-2a37a9a34649"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"HookLength", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"YoungTableau", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"HookLength", "[", 
    RowBox[{
