Cell["\<\
A row index past Length[partition], or a column past \
Length[TransposePartition[shape]], reaches a non-existent partition entry; \
Part::partw is issued and the expression does not evaluate to an integer. \
Always check that {row, col} is inside the diagram before calling HookLength.\
\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->540828900,ExpressionUUID->"dd61557c-1782-4fff-986c-49dd92e1cadc"]
}, Open  ]]
